  "duration_s": 86.307007,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "哎，你什么意思啊，怎么到我这儿就剩半杯了。领导美满美满，代表幸福美满，这一辈子美满就是一辈子美满啊。小李啊，我看你穿衣品味不错嘛，思想上领导的高度我望尘莫及，只能在衣聘上找些自我安慰了。小李，今天让你破费了，领导，您说这些您能来，就是我的荣幸，以后还有很多地方要向您请教。哎，我这肚子喝茶都能胖，领导你那不叫胖，那叫宰相肚里能撑船，装的全是大事儿，年轻就是好啊，年轻就是还不够沉稳，还要向您多学习，我们才能变得更优秀。年李最近表现不错，我的这个位置马上就该你坐了，我得提前敬一杯。听这意思，领导是要高升了呀，我得提前敬领导，一杯不喝就是看不起我。领导，我不是看不起您，我是看不起病，我真不怎么喜欢你，但您从来没有在工作上为难过，我领导的格局值得我们学习关注。我每天学点儿高情商，说话技巧，让你的路越走越宽。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_aae3644f7965b918_s00001",
      "start_ms": 130,
      "end_ms": 370,
      "text": "哎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_aae3644f7965b918_s00002",
      "start_ms": 810,
      "end_ms": 1770,
      "text": "你什么意思啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_aae3644f7965b918_s00003",
      "start_ms": 1870,
      "end_ms": 3470,
      "text": "怎么到我这儿就剩半杯了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_aae3644f7965b918_s00004",
      "start_ms": 3750,
      "end_ms": 5010,
      "text": "领导美满美满，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_aae3644f7965b918_s00005",
      "start_ms": 5150,
      "end_ms": 6210,
      "text": "代表幸福美满，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_aae3644f7965b918_s00006",
      "start_ms": 6350,
      "end_ms": 8490,
      "text": "这一辈子美满就是一辈子美满啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_aae3644f7965b918_s00007",
      "start_ms": 10290,
      "end_ms": 10930,
      "text": "小李啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_aae3644f7965b918_s00008",
      "start_ms": 11230,
      "end_ms": 13210,
      "text": "我看你穿衣品味不错嘛，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_aae3644f7965b918_s00009",
      "start_ms": 14010,
      "end_ms": 16430,
      "text": "思想上领导的高度我望尘莫及，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_aae3644f7965b918_s00010",
      "start_ms": 16770,
      "end_ms": 18710,
      "text": "只能在衣聘上找些自我安慰了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_aae3644f7965b918_s00011",
      "start_ms": 20090,
      "end_ms": 20510,
      "text": "小李，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_aae3644f7965b918_s00012",
      "start_ms": 21070,
      "end_ms": 22190,
      "text": "今天让你破费了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_aae3644f7965b918_s00013",
      "start_ms": 22430,
      "end_ms": 22850,
      "text": "领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_aae3644f7965b918_s00014",
      "start_ms": 23050,
      "end_ms": 24650,
      "text": "您说这些您能来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_aae3644f7965b918_s00015",
      "start_ms": 24650,
      "end_ms": 25470,
      "text": "就是我的荣幸，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_aae3644f7965b918_s00016",
      "start_ms": 25750,
      "end_ms": 28855,
      "text": "以后还有很多地方要向您请教。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_aae3644f7965b918_s00017",
      "start_ms": 30220,
      "end_ms": 30460,
      "text": "哎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_aae3644f7965b918_s00018",
      "start_ms": 30620,
      "end_ms": 32220,
      "text": "我这肚子喝茶都能胖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_aae3644f7965b918_s00019",
      "start_ms": 32700,
      "end_ms": 34060,
      "text": "领导你那不叫胖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_aae3644f7965b918_s00020",
      "start_ms": 34300,
      "end_ms": 35860,
      "text": "那叫宰相肚里能撑船，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_aae3644f7965b918_s00021",
      "start_ms": 36220,
      "end_ms": 37480,
      "text": "装的全是大事儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_aae3644f7965b918_s00022",
      "start_ms": 40280,
      "end_ms": 41740,
      "text": "年轻就是好啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_aae3644f7965b918_s00023",
      "start_ms": 42760,
      "end_ms": 44200,
      "text": "年轻就是还不够沉稳，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_aae3644f7965b918_s00024",
      "start_ms": 44600,
      "end_ms": 45760,
      "text": "还要向您多学习，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_aae3644f7965b918_s00025",
      "start_ms": 46200,
      "end_ms": 47380,
      "text": "我们才能变得更优秀。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_aae3644f7965b918_s00026",
      "start_ms": 50180,
      "end_ms": 52180,
      "text": "年李最近表现不错，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_aae3644f7965b918_s00027",
      "start_ms": 52520,
      "end_ms": 54460,
      "text": "我的这个位置马上就该你坐了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_aae3644f7965b918_s00028",
      "start_ms": 54480,
      "end_ms": 55580,
      "text": "我得提前敬一杯。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_aae3644f7965b918_s00029",
      "start_ms": 56160,
      "end_ms": 56800,
      "text": "听这意思，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_aae3644f7965b918_s00030",
      "start_ms": 56820,
      "end_ms": 57860,
      "text": "领导是要高升了呀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_aae3644f7965b918_s00031",
      "start_ms": 57860,
      "end_ms": 58800,
      "text": "我得提前敬领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_aae3644f7965b918_s00032",
      "start_ms": 58800,
      "end_ms": 62665,
      "text": "一杯不喝就是看不起我。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_aae3644f7965b918_s00033",
      "start_ms": 63490,
      "end_ms": 63870,
      "text": "领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_aae3644f7965b918_s00034",
      "start_ms": 63930,
      "end_ms": 64945,
      "text": "我不是看不起您，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_aae3644f7965b918_s00035",
      "start_ms": 65260,
      "end_ms": 66245,
      "text": "我是看不起病，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_aae3644f7965b918_s00036",
      "start_ms": 70460,
      "end_ms": 71735,
      "text": "我真不怎么喜欢你，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_aae3644f7965b918_s00037",
      "start_ms": 72390,
      "end_ms": 74390,
      "text": "但您从来没有在工作上为难过，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_aae3644f7965b918_s00038",
      "start_ms": 74390,
      "end_ms": 80730,
      "text": "我领导的格局值得我们学习关注。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_aae3644f7965b918_s00039",
      "start_ms": 80730,
      "end_ms": 82880,
      "text": "我每天学点儿高情商，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_aae3644f7965b918_s00040",
      "start_ms": 83000,
      "end_ms": 83815,
      "text": "说话技巧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_aae3644f7965b918_s00041",
      "start_ms": 84170,
      "end_ms": 86095,
      "text": "让你的路越走越宽。"
    }
  ],
